caption: Mastery Requirements
tradition-component: mastery-requirements

Possess one Low Magic Tradition Path.

Know at least 9 Low Magic spells at effective skill 20+, drawn from at least four different colleges.

Apply at least one Flourish on five separate successful castings in consequential play. The same Flourish may be used each time.

Spend at least 100 total FP or Magic Energy Reserve on spellcasting
